Please review the code cleanliness of every local git branch in this repo.

For each branch, check it out, look through the codebase, and write a short report in the reports/ folder. Also create a reports/summary.md file that ranks all branches from cleanest to messiest.

For each branch report, include:

overall cleanliness score (1–10)
short summary
main strengths
biggest issues
a few concrete examples with file paths
top cleanup recommendations

Please focus on things like readability, naming, organization, separation of concerns, duplication, unnecessary complexity, dead code, comments, and overall maintainability.

A few constraints:

don’t modify any source code
don’t commit anything
only write files into reports/

Use filenames like reports/<branch-name>.md for the per-branch reports.